BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 720.00 Tm (DOC_ID: SAFETY_DOC_007) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 706.80 Tm (TITLE: CardioZen and Serum Potassium Monitoring in Patients with Chronic Kidney Disease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 693.60 Tm (PUBLISHER: HealthOne Group Medication Safety Committee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 680.40 Tm (PUBLICATION_DATE: 2026-03-01) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 667.20 Tm (STATUS: ACTIVE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 654.00 Tm (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640.80 Tm (HEALTHONE GROUP - MEDICATION SAFETY COMMUNICATION) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 614.40 Tm (Document ID: SAFETY_DOC_007) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 601.20 Tm (Issued: 1 March 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 588.00 Tm (Classification: Safety Communication - Action Required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 561.60 Tm (| SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT - NOT REAL MEDICAL GUIDANCE. This document is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 548.40 Tm (| fabricated for the purposes of a software demonstration. CardioZen is an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 535.20 Tm (| invented medication that does not exist. Nothing in this document describes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 522.00 Tm (| any real product, and nothing in it should be used to inform any clinical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 508.80 Tm (| decision.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 482.40 Tm (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 456.00 Tm (This communication informs prescribers, pharmacists and clinical review staff) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 442.80 Tm (of a monitoring requirement applying to patients treated with CardioZen who) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 429.60 Tm (also carry a diagnosis of chronic kidney disease. It supersedes no previous) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 416.40 Tm (communication. It takes effect on the date of issue.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 390.00 Tm (2. Background) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 363.60 Tm (CardioZen is cleared substantially by renal excretion. In patients whose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 350.40 Tm (kidney function is already reduced, clearance is slower and plasma) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 337.20 Tm (concentrations accumulate over a period of weeks. The principal consequence of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 324.00 Tm (accumulation is a rise in serum potassium.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 297.60 Tm (Post-marketing surveillance across the HealthOne network identified eleven) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 284.40 Tm (cases over the preceding eighteen months in which potassium elevation was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 271.20 Tm (identified only after the patient became symptomatic. In nine of those eleven) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 258.00 Tm (cases, no potassium measurement had been recorded in the preceding six months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244.80 Tm (The Committee's view is that the interval between measurements, rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231.60 Tm (the availability of the measurement itself, was the contributing factor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 205.20 Tm (3. Monitoring requirement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 178.80 Tm (For any patient receiving CardioZen who has a recorded diagnosis of chronic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 165.60 Tm (kidney disease, serum potassium should be checked at least every three months) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 152.40 Tm (for the duration of therapy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 126.00 Tm (The requirement applies from the date of this communication. It applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 112.80 Tm (patients already established on CardioZen as well as to new starts. Where a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 99.60 Tm (patient has had no potassium measurement within the stated interval, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 86.40 Tm (responsible clinical team should arrange one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 40 Tm (Page 1 of 2 - SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT) Tj ET
