BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 720.00 Tm (4. Population not covered by this requirement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 693.60 Tm (Patients receiving CardioZen who do not carry a diagnosis of chronic kidney) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 680.40 Tm (disease are outside the scope of section 3. The Committee considered whether to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 667.20 Tm (extend the requirement to all CardioZen recipients and concluded that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 654.00 Tm (evidence does not presently support it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 627.60 Tm (5. Reporting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 601.20 Tm (Suspected adverse reactions should be reported through the usual HealthOne) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 588.00 Tm (pharmacovigilance channel. Reporting is not a substitute for the monitoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 574.80 Tm (described in section 3.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 548.40 Tm (6. Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 522.00 Tm (This communication will be reviewed within twelve months of issue, or earlier) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 508.80 Tm (if surveillance data warrant it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 482.40 Tm (- End of document -) Tj ET
